e report builder\n     - Added `DueDiligenceFindingType` enum and `RISK_SUMMARY_SPEC` declarative spec\n     - `generate_risk_summary()` reduced from ~61 lines to ~3 lines\n\n   - **`src/components/report/visualizations/GraphVisualization.tsx`** - NEW: Unified graph visualization primitive\n     - Exports: `GraphNode`, `GraphEdge`, `GraphLayoutStrategy`, `GraphLayoutOptions`, `GraphVisualizationProps`\n     - Supports 5 layout strategies with `useGraphLayout` hook\n\n   - **`src/components/report/features/ReadingMode.tsx`** - NEW: Unified reading mode component\n     - Consolidates FocusMode and SpeedReader into single component\n     - Exports: `ReadingMode`, `FocusMode` (deprecated), `SpeedReader` (deprecated)\n     - Contains `ReadingOverlay`, `SpotlightContent`, `SpeedReaderContent` internal components\n\n   - **`src/components/report/features/ReadingModeLauncher.tsx`** - NEW: Keyboard shortcut launcher\n     - Press R to open launcher modal, F/1 for Focus, S/2 for Speed\n     - Exports: `ReadingModeLauncher`, `useReadingModeLauncher`\n\n   - **`src/components/report/features/index.tsx`** - Updated exports\n     ```typescript\n     // Unified reading mode (spotlight + speed reader)\n     export { ReadingMode, FocusMode, SpeedReader } from './ReadingMode';\n     export type { ReadingModeProps, ReadingModeType } from './ReadingMode';\n\n     // Reading mode launcher (keyboard shortcut: R)\n     export { ReadingModeLauncher, useReadingModeLauncher } from './ReadingModeLauncher';\n     export type { ReadingModeLauncherProps } from './ReadingModeLauncher';\n\n     // Other features\n     export { IntelDashboard } from './IntelDashboard';\n     export { KeyPointsPanel } from './KeyPointsPanel';\n     ```\n\n   - **Deleted files**: `FocusMode.tsx`, `SpeedReader.tsx` (functionality moved to ReadingMode.tsx)\n\n4. Errors and fixes:\n   - **GraphVisualization.tsx type error**: `Conversion of type 'GraphNode' to type 'Record<string, unknown>' may be a mistake`\n     - Fixe